# Titan 2 Elite hardware keyboard: the full emoji picker opened with SYM stays open for several emoji
# and a skin tone while "Keep the emoji picker open after typing an emoji" is on (the default, also
# when never saved). SYM closes it and the keys type again; after reopening it still stays open.
# Run with either SYM auto-close setting; the full picker uses only its own setting.
# Needs the SYM page "Emoji picker" enabled after the default pages (device, emoji, symbols; SYM
# four times opens it), 😀, 😂 and 👋🏽 visible when the picker opens (recents or the first page).
require profile titan2elite_qwerty
require layout qwerty
preserve keyboard mode
hw type ok
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen press emoji:😀
wait 300
screen press emoji:😂
expect Ok😀😂
screen hold emoji:👋🏽
wait 1000
screen release emoji:👋🏽
wait 300
screen press variant:👋🏿
wait 300
screen press emoji:😀
expect Ok😀😂👋🏿😀
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw type " a"
expect "Ok😀😂👋🏿😀 a"
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw press AGUI_SYM
wait 800
screen press emoji:😂
wait 300
screen press emoji:😂
expect "Ok😀😂👋🏿😀 a😂😂"
hw press AGUI_SYM
hw type b
expect "Ok😀😂👋🏿😀 a😂😂b"
